        {
          "name": "基础信息",
          "is_poped": false,
          "components": [
            {
              "component_id": "rich_base_info",
              "layout": "",
              "data": "{\"list\":[{\"key\":\" 稀有度 \",\"value\":[\"<p>4星/5星</p>\"]},{\"key\":\" 获取途径 \",\"value\":[\"<p><span class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"375\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/03/30/4328207/65da75cf98aab0039fdec178a8d7890f_3912101975412580177.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"孤云凌霄之处\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/375/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"><a href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/375/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"><span class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"name\\\">孤云凌霄之处</span></span></a></span>：惊蛰Ⅲ～Ⅴ概率掉落（4星）；惊蛰Ⅴ～Ⅵ概率掉落（5星）；</p><p>合成台「还圣奥迹」获取；</p><p><span class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"502145\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/08/28/50494840/d29726b96c9ee790cae261ddbc5f9989_3936286629804858604.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"圣言自明机\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/502145/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"><a href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/502145/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"><span class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"name\\\">圣言自明机</span></span></a></span>定义获取。</p>\"]},{\"key\":\"2件套效果 \",\"value\":[\"<p>获得15%岩元素伤害加成。</p>\"]},{\"key\":\"4件套效果 \",\"value\":[\"<p>获得结晶反应形成的晶片或触发月结晶反应时，队伍中所有角色获得35%对应元素伤害加成，持续10秒。同时只能通过该效果获得一种元素伤害加成。</p>\"]}]}\n",
              "style": ""
            }
          ],
