        {
          "name": "搭配推荐",
          "is_poped": false,
          "components": [
            {
              "component_id": "multi_table",
              "layout": "",
              "data": "{\"tables\":[{\"tab_name\":\"角色推荐\",\"header\":[\"角色名称\",\"推荐原因\",\"词缀搭配\"],\"row\":[[\"<p><span class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"502306\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/10/04/4328207/ff1745c76b33c041c26e64e137dae368_8553993354333645956.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"希诺宁\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/502306/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"><a href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/502306/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"><img class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/10/04/4328207/ff1745c76b33c041c26e64e137dae368_8553993354333645956.png\\\"><span class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"name\\\">希诺宁</span></span></a></span></p>\",\"<p>悠古的磐岩四件套可在装备者拾取晶片时为队友提供对应元素伤害加成，可提升角色辅助能力。</p><p>由于需要专门走位捡晶片，一般仅在其他队友携带了<span class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"502057\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"text\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://act-upload.mihoyo.com/wiki-user-upload/2024/08/26/4521515/326692dcbc3de80cffca233f714f7593_4868244897715801683.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"烬城勇者绘卷\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/502057/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"><a href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/502057/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-text\\\"><span class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"name\\\">烬城勇者绘卷</span></span></a></span>四件套时再考虑使用。</p>\",\"<p><strong>时之沙：</strong>元素充能效率/防御力</p><p><strong>空之杯：</strong>防御力</p><p><strong>理之冠：</strong>暴击率/防御力</p>\"],[\"<p><span class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1290\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/6682780141a9e7788da99c71b1cfd5c3_6751062493374563471.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"钟离\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1290/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"><a href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1290/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"><img class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/6682780141a9e7788da99c71b1cfd5c3_6751062493374563471.png\\\"><span class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"name\\\">钟离</span></span></a></span></p>\",\"<p>悠古的磐岩四件套可在装备者拾取晶片时为队友提供对应元素伤害加成，可提升角色辅助能力。</p><p>使用时需要注意敌人元素附着并练习捡晶片走位手法。</p>\",\"<p><strong>时之沙：</strong>生命值/元素充能效率</p><p><strong>空之杯：</strong>生命值/岩元素伤害加成</p><p><strong>理之冠：</strong>生命值/暴击率/暴击伤害</p>\"],[\"<p><span class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"3387\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/01/05/16314655/6f4bbe7d060f72a0c84e868887ac7a32_4711867403945994990.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"云堇\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3387/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"><a href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/3387/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"><img class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2022/01/05/16314655/6f4bbe7d060f72a0c84e868887ac7a32_4711867403945994990.png\\\"><span class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"name\\\">云堇</span></span></a></span></p>\",\"<p>悠古的磐岩四件套可在装备者拾取晶片时为队友提供对应元素伤害加成，可提升角色辅助能力。</p><p>使用时需要注意敌人元素附着并练习捡晶片走位手法。</p>\",\"<p><strong>时之沙：</strong>元素充能效率/防御力</p><p><strong>空之杯：</strong>防御力</p><p><strong>理之冠：</strong>防御力/暴击率/暴击伤害</p>\"],[\"<p><span class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1360\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/01009cc20f9a4ebf4ece5e96fdecad1a_3067405046796818316.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"阿贝多\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1360/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"><a href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1360/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"><img class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2021/08/23/75276545/01009cc20f9a4ebf4ece5e96fdecad1a_3067405046796818316.png\\\"><span class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"name\\\">阿贝多</span></span></a></span></p>\",\"<p>悠古的磐岩四件套可在装备者拾取晶片时为队友提供对应元素伤害加成，可提升角色辅助能力</p><p>使用时需要注意敌人元素附着并练习捡晶片走位手法。</p>\",\"<p><strong>时之沙：</strong>防御力</p><p><strong>空之杯：</strong>岩元素伤害加成</p><p><strong>理之冠：</strong>暴击率/暴击伤害</p>\"]]},{\"tab_name\":\"圣遗物成长数据\",\"header\":[\"\"],\"row\":[[\"<p style=\\\"text-align: center\\\"><span class=\\\"custom-entry-wrapper\\\" data-entry-id=\\\"1279\\\" data-entry-ratio=\\\"small\\\" data-entry-img=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/11/29/76373921/d8aa4bdb17f0e16298b05c10bc149846_1243318391411958522.png\\\" data-entry-name=\\\"圣遗物成长数据\\\" data-entry-link=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1279/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" data-entry-status=\\\"Online\\\"><a href=\\\"/ys/obc/content/1279/detail?bbs_presentation_style=no_header\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\" class=\\\"entry-material-box entry-material-small\\\"><img class=\\\"image\\\" src=\\\"https://uploadstatic.mihoyo.com/ys-obc/2020/11/29/76373921/d8aa4bdb17f0e16298b05c10bc149846_1243318391411958522.png\\\"><span class=\\\"entry-material-wrap\\\"><span class=\\\"name\\\">圣遗物成长数据</span></span></a></span></p>\"]]}]}\n",
